        "title": "Add on-screen text alert option for quota warnings",
        "body": "Fixes #1691\n\n## Summary\n\n- Add a General preference beside quota-warning sound to show the same warning copy as a centered on-screen card.\n- Keep the option off by default; notification behavior is unchanged unless the user opts in.\n- Keep the panel click-through, nonactivating, above normal windows, multi-space compatible, auto-dismissing, and Reduce Motion aware.\n- Expose the warning title and detail through accessibility label/value.\n- Prevent a canceled older dismissal task from closing a replacement alert by gating presentation generations.\n- Localize the setting across all shipped catalogs and thank @SAASEmpiree in the changelog.\n\n## Maintainer decision\n\nRecommendation: merge. This is a bounded opt-in that exactly matches the issue request and reuses existing threshold/redaction copy. The tradeoff is a visually prominent warning card; default-off behavior, click-through presentation, and no focus activation keep it non-disruptive.\n\n## Proof\n\n- Exact reviewed head: `c1b7bd2ed96c9402d0180b3d4dee0dc129720fe7`.\n- `make check` passed with zero SwiftLint violations.\n- Focused state/model coverage passed: `QuotaWarningAlertPresentationStateTests` (2), `SettingsStoreTests` (68), `UsageStoreSessionQuotaTransitionTests` (23), and `CommandCodeQuotaTransitionTests` (3).\n- `make test` passed all 526 selections across all 44 groups; the Kiro suite passed without retry.\n- Exact-head branch-scoped autoreview was clean with no accepted/actionable findings (0.84 confidence).\n- `./Scripts/package_app.sh` completed; host codesign verification passed. Exact binary UUID: `5DAECC71-4015-3F4B-9241-228318BCCF38`; SHA-256: `e8776a7b4b8ea7a41bc57b1a59893504bcdfeb4a5afaf1133b2c32a080e60997`.\n- Tart provider proof used lease `cbx_6f2e51df5507`. The symlink-preserving bundle `/Users/admin/Applications/CodexBar-1692-c1b7bd2-tar.app` passed remote deep/strict codesign; remote UUID and SHA-256 matched the host package; PID `22362` ran that exact bundle.\n- Live defaults readback confirmed quota warnings, session/weekly windows, and the on-screen alert enabled for the proof profile.\n- Exact-binary VNC and Peekaboo/Screen Sharing captures confirmed the General setting and the centered warning card with the production title/detail copy. The card appeared without stealing focus over the existing Settings window and auto-dismissed on its production lifecycle.\n- Replacement exact-head CI passed all 10 checks: [run 28527997973](https://github.com/steipete/CodexBar/actions/runs/28527997973).\n\n## Contributor media\n\nSettings:\n\n![Quota warning settings showing the new Show on-screen text alert checkbox](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SAASEmpiree/CodexBar/pr1692-media/.github/pr-media/onscreen-alert-settings.png)\n\nCentered alert:\n\n![Centered on-screen quota warning card](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SAASEmpiree/CodexBar/pr1692-media/.github/pr-media/onscreen-alert-card.png)\n\nThe contributor captured the card through a local-only preview trigger; that preview control is not included in this PR.\n",
